The robot visual meshes and model geometry originate from RoboParty's RPO
models. Preserve CERN-OHL-W-2.0 for the model geometry and the RoboLab
BSD-3-Clause notices for the training URDF source. These assets are not
relicensed by the software package's GPL or upstream Apache license.

Modified 2026-10-26 for this RPO experiment: floating root, 23 actuated joints,
training collision groups, hand tracking sites, official joint ranges and
coupled motor-actuation variants. Original mesh geometry is retained.
The modified MJCF, mesh files and source URDF are included in this directory.
